{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268jcouuxHai1794887463.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人趙晞文表示，觀望科網股業績及晶片相關新措施，港股不排除於23,000點水平徘徊。</p><p></p><p>元宇證券大中華區股票投資總監趙晞文表示：「短期下試大概23,000點附近，概率也頗高，始終本周看港股自身均圍繞幾間大型科技股季績，基本上未必出很大意外，基本上已做好預期管理。反而更重要是，接下來焦點在第四季，甚至部分標的來說，近期圍繞晶片的事端會否有較清晰解畫，所以暫時看大市仍是偏弱，下方先看23,000點。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.403761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:56:22.158350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:45.502325+00:00","content_hash":"159ab4d2f0f7d043c81d03ef4821feae42f7f4a3b412f1f27ecb86bde80704ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.403761+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}